id: weapon-specialist
name: Weapon Specialist
talentCategory: weapon
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You are especially skilled with a Weapon.
text: >
  Weapon Specialist: You are especially skilled with a Weapon.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Passive]: Ignore the Weapon Penalty.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Dice Score for a Clash made through the Disarm Maneuver by 1(bT).

---

[passive]
# (1) No Weapon Penalty on a Strike made with a Weapon - an attack's or a Parry's (gear.mjs weaponSpecialist).
allow weapon.noPenalty;
# (2) Waits on the Disarm Maneuver, not built yet.
